WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:04.204 line:0%
-Chevrolet is committed
to an electric future

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:07.373 line:0%
by making electric vehicles
more accessible for everyone.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.709
-Wow, everyone?
-Oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.377
This is one of my writers,
John Lutz.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:12.545
Uh, John,
what are you doing here?

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.013
-Well, I wanted to thank you.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:15.347
-Thank me for what?

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:17.016
-For getting everyone who works
here at "Late Night"

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:19.252
a Chevy electric vehicle
for our holiday bonus.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.122
-Lutz, I'm not giving everyone
an electric vehicle.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:23.790
-Okay.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.791
Then, uh...

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:27.727
Then, just me?

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.728
-No.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.230
-Aw, come on.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.064
I've worked here
since the show started.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:33.733
What has that been,
like three years?

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.769
-It's been almost nine.

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:37.436
-Yeah. Yeah, it's been nine.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:39.138
But when you count
how much I actually worked,

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.407
it's only been two.
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:43.009
-I'm not getting you an E.V.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.677
-Fine.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.545
How about a scooter?
-No.

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:47.881
-A bike?
-No.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.381
-Skateboard?
-You know, I gotta be honest.

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.218
I'm just having trouble
seeing you on a skateboard.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.552
-What? Why?

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.387
Because of all this?

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.724
-Whoo-whoo!
-Whoo!

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.893
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.228
-They can see it.
They can see it.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.329
Come on, Seth,
you gotta give me something.

00:01:04.329 --> 00:01:05.465
This is the holidays.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.132
-Uh, alright.
Eh, fine.

00:01:07.132 --> 00:01:08.967
Come on over here.
Um...

00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:11.604
What if I gave you, um...

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.605
that.

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.606
-Aha! Sold!

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:16.442
[ Laughs ] Whoo! Score!

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:17.777
-Hey, Seth,
I'd also like to thank you

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:18.944
for my holiday bonus --

00:01:18.944 --> 00:01:21.347
an all-electric
Chevy Equinox E.V.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.015
-Wait, what?

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:25.684
-You're welcome, Wally.
You deserve it, pal.

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:28.354
-Thanks, Seth.
Hey, nice mug, Lutz.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:31.190
-Yeah, I got a mug.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.526
Hooray for me.
[ Laughs tightly ]

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.527
[ Inhales sharply ]

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.530
Have an electric holiday,
everybody!

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.532
-Yikes!

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.835
At least you didn't end this one
with that stupid wink.

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.503
-[ Laughing ]
Oh, I almost forgot!

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:45.838
Thanks for reminding me, Seth.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:47.340
Have an electric holiday.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.008
Wink!

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.110
-Wink!

